  Solution A — Optimal: Port Galvatron's Slice-Gather into ColossalAI
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  Galvatron (github.com/PKU-DAIR/Hetu-Galvatron) solves the resharding problem with a Slice-Gather mechanism in galvatron/core/runtime/redistribute.py. The key idea: at every PP stage boundary where the sending stage's TP degree differs from the receiving
   stage's TP degree, automatically inject one of:                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                  
  - all_gather — stage N was TP=4 (tensor sharded), stage N+1 is TP=1 (replicated)                                                                                                                                                                             
  - split — stage N was TP=1, stage N+1 is TP=4
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  This is done in hybrid_parallel_model.py via wrap_modules_relocation() which computes layer_tp_sizes (a list of TP degrees per layer) and injects the collective at each transition point.                                                                   
   
  How to adapt this to your ColossalAI plan:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                  
  Add a boundary_resharding.py to your pipeline_shard/ module:                                                                                                                                                                                                 
   
  # colossalai/auto_parallel/pipeline_shard/boundary_resharding.py                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  class BoundaryAllGather(torch.autograd.Function):
      """Insert between stages when sender TP > receiver TP (or TP→no-TP)."""                                                                                                                                                                                  
      @staticmethod                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
      def forward(ctx, input, tp_group):
          ctx.tp_group = tp_group                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          # gather shards from all TP ranks → full tensor                                                                                                                                                                                                      
          return all_gather_tensor(input, tp_group)                                                                                                                                                                                                            
      @staticmethod                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
      def backward(ctx, grad):                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
          # split gradient back for upstream TP ranks
          return split_tensor(grad, ctx.tp_group), None                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  class BoundarySplit(torch.autograd.Function):                                                                                                                                                                                                                
      """Insert between stages when receiver TP > sender TP."""                                                                                                                                                                                                
      @staticmethod
      def forward(ctx, input, tp_group, rank):
          ctx.save_for_backward(torch.tensor(rank))                                                                                                                                                                                                            
          return input.chunk(dist.get_world_size(tp_group))[rank]
      @staticmethod                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
      def backward(ctx, grad):
          return all_gather_tensor(grad, ...), None, None                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  def get_boundary_op(sender_tp: int, receiver_tp: int):                                                                                                                                                                                                       
      """Returns the op to insert between stages, or None if no resharding needed."""                                                                                                                                                                          
      if sender_tp == receiver_tp:                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          return None
      elif sender_tp > receiver_tp:
          return BoundaryAllGather   # gather before passing to next stage
      else:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
          return BoundarySplit       # scatter to next stage's TP ranks
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
