  Solution B — Heuristic (Sub-optimal): Constrain to Uniform TP at Boundaries                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  If you want working code faster and the resharding complexity is too high for now, you can avoid the problem entirely by adding a single constraint: all pipeline stages must use the same TP degree.
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  In practice, this is what Megatron-LM, DeepSpeed, and most production systems do. The search space becomes:                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  For each PP stage: TP degree must equal T (fixed for all stages)                                                                                                                                                                                             
  → only DP degree can vary per stage (or be fixed too)                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  How to implement in your plan:                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  In compute_cost.py, filter submesh_choices to only include submeshes compatible with a fixed TP degree:                                                                                                                                                      
                  
  # Only consider submeshes with the same TP column count                                                                                                                                                                                                      
  target_tp = submesh_choices[0][1]  # or pass as parameter
  submesh_choices = [s for s in submesh_choices if s[1] == target_tp]                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  Then the rest of your plan (alpa_dp + initialize_model + PipelineStageManager) works as-is — no resharding needed at stage boundaries because all stages have identical sharding specs.                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  This is still better than manual planning because:                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  - alpa_dp still auto-finds the optimal number of pipeline stages
  - alpa_dp still auto-assigns layers to stages optimally (not just equal split)                                                                                                                                                                               
  - initialize_model still optimizes the TP strategy within the uniform TP constraint
  - You get 3D parallelism, just with the constraint TP_stage0 == TP_stage1 == ...                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
