  Recommended Path                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  Given that ColossalAI already has the TP+DP solver but lacks the resharding bridge, this two-phase approach makes sense:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  Phase 1 (now):  Heuristic — uniform TP across stages                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                  → Unblock the full pipeline. Working 3D training.                                                                                                                                                                                            
                  → Produces sub-optimal plans but correct results.                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  Phase 2 (after):  Port Galvatron's Slice-Gather + update cost model                                                                                                                                                                                          
                    → Full heterogeneous 3D. Potentially 10-20% better throughput                                                                                                                                                                              
                      (per Galvatron paper, heterogeneous TP helps for uneven layers).                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
